  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Light of intensity 500 W m<sup>−2</sup> is incident on concrete and on snow. 300 W m<sup>−2</sup> is reflected from the<br/>concrete and 400 W m<sup>−2</sup> is reflected from the snow.</p>\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textit{albedo of concrete}}{\\textit{albedo of snow}}\"></span>?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3}{4}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4}{3}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\">2</li></ol>"
